---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Disclaimer | AKTU Result Without DOB"
  description="Read our legal disclaimer outlining our status as a third-party student utility separate from AKTU."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-black light:bg-white text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600 text-left">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white light:text-ink mb-8 border-b border-canvas-dark-border pb-4">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Last Updated: July 2026
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-white light:text-ink">
          Please read this legal disclaimer carefully before utilizing our search assistance engine.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">1. Academic & Affiliation Status</h3>
        <p>
          **AKTU Result Without DOB** is an independent, student-built search utility. This website is **not** affiliated with, authorized, sponsored, licensed, or in any way officially associated with Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), the Government of Uttar Pradesh, or any of their subsidiary academic councils.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">2. Third-Party Trademarks</h3>
        <p>
          All product names, logos, brands, trademarks, and registered trademarks (including "AKTU", "AKTU One View", "UPTU") are the property of their respective owners. Use of these names on this website does not imply any affiliation, sponsorship, or endorsement.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">3. Accuracy of Information</h3>
        <p>
          While we strive to ensure that the retrieved academic details are accurate and up-to-date by utilizing live validation handshakes with the university portal, we accept no responsibility for server errors, incorrect result outputs resulting from portal data anomalies, or network timeouts.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">4. Financial Responsibility</h3>
        <p>
          Our search tool is free for student query lookups. The developer is not liable for any academic delays, losses, or inconveniences resulting from database lookups or temporary downtime of the search engine.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
